{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor planning has put you in a tough situation: your spacecraft is nearly out of power and an abandoned derelict freighter is your only chance for survival. Can you overcome the tricky obstacles that await you and collect enough power to make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ca73d5d53ba8f201c9e6898f974444ad.poster.avif?t=1772751334\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ca73d5d53ba8f201c9e6898f974444ad.webm?t=1772751334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am obsessed with platformers and the minute details of how they control and I wanted to create a game that features the things I love most in the genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a focus on exploration in a large non-linear world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >simple and intuitive controls that are hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >movement that highlights both momentum and pixel precision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I spent countless hours hand-crafting challenges and tweaking the physics for this game until they felt perfect to me, and I hope you enjoy what I've created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 \u2764\ufe0f gate</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 screens to navigate and explore in a large contiguous world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn mechanics and controls through intuitive gameplay -- no explicit tutorials or unnecessary hand-holding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No permanent upgrades: objectives can be tackled in any order, gated only by your improving skill as a player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of optional secrets and collectables. Retrieving them all will be a challenge, even for platforming experts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game hint menu and assist options for players that want more help or guidance\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ad275ef48287443317fcf66c1f99f905.poster.avif?t=1772751334\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=896 height=896 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ad275ef48287443317fcf66c1f99f905.webm?t=1772751334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ad275ef48287443317fcf66c1f99f905.mp4?t=1772751334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641010?t=1772751334","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641010?t=1772751334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/edb11bd8bcce336de7979ae314de05620e87cb79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772751334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/edb11bd8bcce336de7979ae314de05620e87cb79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772751334","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poor planning has put you in a tough situation: your spacecraft is nearly out of power and an abandoned derelict freighter is your only chance for survival. Can you overcome the tricky obstacles that await you and collect enough power to make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ca73d5d53ba8f201c9e6898f974444ad.poster.avif?t=1772751334\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ca73d5d53ba8f201c9e6898f974444ad.webm?t=1772751334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am obsessed with platformers and the minute details of how they control and I wanted to create a game that features the things I love most in the genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a focus on exploration in a large non-linear world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >simple and intuitive controls that are hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >movement that highlights both momentum and pixel precision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I spent countless hours hand-crafting challenges and tweaking the physics for this game until they felt perfect to me, and I hope you enjoy what I've created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 \u2764\ufe0f gate</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 screens to navigate and explore in a large contiguous world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn mechanics and controls through intuitive gameplay -- no explicit tutorials or unnecessary hand-holding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No permanent upgrades: objectives can be tackled in any order, gated only by your improving skill as a player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of optional secrets and collectables. Retrieving them all will be a challenge, even for platforming experts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game hint menu and assist options for players that want more help or guidance\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ad275ef48287443317fcf66c1f99f905.poster.avif?t=1772751334\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=896 height=896 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ad275ef48287443317fcf66c1f99f905.webm?t=1772751334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/extras/ad275ef48287443317fcf66c1f99f905.mp4?t=1772751334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["gate"],"dlc":[4085630],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641010/e81f432d8145b3cc9ce2b5261cc52285b8c2a813/header.jpg?t=1772751334","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 or ARM CPU (Apple Silicon) e.g. Intel Core 2 Duo SU9400, Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with Vulkan 1.0 or Metal 3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</l